{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/mHPJkJ6gPlv8ucYGksrIhw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:48.953871+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/mHPJkJ6gPlv8ucYGksrIhw","html":"<div><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OBK0Wz5WVnbVv4EZI75MH0MHrKtLqMt3zJuIYfJx2ytgwAvAObCwXjgHha1bibnbicicMYWQ4nk5vg8wM3Sg0G6pw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OBK0Wz5WVnbVv4EZI75MH0MHrKtLqMt3zJuIYfJx2ytgwAvAObCwXjgHha1bibnbicicMYWQ4nk5vg8wM3Sg0G6pw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>为促进全国优秀大学生之间的交流互动，激发大学生科研兴趣和热情，选拔全国优秀本科生到医学科技创新中心（简称“科创中心”）学习深造，科创中心将于7月8日和7月10日两天举办“2025 年研究生学术夏令营”活动，具体事宜通知如下：</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OBK0Wz5WVnbVv4EZI75MH0MHrKtLqMt3KuVkUmJvMNnGNBIYUUvtLIEvz3Ifba9iaKZhMmrrhwONpG3P9pemJzw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>01、学院简介</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OBK0Wz5WVnbVv4EZI75MH0MHrKtLqMt3KuVkUmJvMNnGNBIYUUvtLIEvz3Ifba9iaKZhMmrrhwONpG3P9pemJzw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>科创中心是校（院）重点打造的科研创新平台，配备了大型仪器设备共享平台、标准化PI实验室、校企共建实验室、大型生物样本库、高级生物安全实验室和公共技术平台等设施。依托重大科研利器，充分发挥其作为原始创新发源地的作用，全方位助力人才培养和教学发展。现有骨干及以上入驻人才66人，其中，国家杰青5人，长江学者3人，国家优青6人，泰山学者30人，山东省高校青创团队27个。拥有博士研究生导师16人，硕士研究生导师65人。近三年，教师团队共承担各级科研课题 355 项，其中，国家级课题150余项，包括国家重点研发计划、国家重大研究计划等。获省级科学技术进步奖一等奖 1 项、二等奖 3 项、青年奖1项。获批山东省工程研究中心 1 个，山东省临床医学研究中心1个，获批市厅级重点实验室 5 个。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OBK0Wz5WVnbVv4EZI75MH0MHrKtLqMt3KuVkUmJvMNnGNBIYUUvtLIEvz3Ifba9iaKZhMmrrhwONpG3P9pemJzw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>02、活动安排</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OBK0Wz5WVnbVv4EZI75MH0MHrKtLqMt3KuVkUmJvMNnGNBIYUUvtLIEvz3Ifba9iaKZhMmrrhwONpG3P9pemJzw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>活动拟定于7月8日和7月10日两天举行，夏令营内容包括科研平台参观、学术前沿讲座、科研项目实践、虚拟仿真实验等多种形式的活动。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OBK0Wz5WVnbVv4EZI75MH0MHrKtLqMt3KuVkUmJvMNnGNBIYUUvtLIEvz3Ifba9iaKZhMmrrhwONpG3P9pemJzw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>03、申报条件</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OBK0Wz5WVnbVv4EZI75MH0MHrKtLqMt3KuVkUmJvMNnGNBIYUUvtLIEvz3Ifba9iaKZhMmrrhwONpG3P9pemJzw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1、政治思想品德良好、学术道德规范、身心健康。</span></p><p><span>2、生物医学工程、医学影像技术、生物学、基础医学、公共卫生、药学等相关专业的高校在读本科生，含应届毕业生和三年级以上本科生。</span></p><p><span>3、学习成绩排名前列，有意向以推荐免试或公开招考方式报考山东第一医科大学硕士研究生的高校在读本科生。</span></p><p><span>4、对科研活动具有浓厚的学习兴趣，有志于从事学术研究工作，有较强科研能力和科研潜质。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OBK0Wz5WVnbVv4EZI75MH0MHrKtLqMt3KuVkUmJvMNnGNBIYUUvtLIEvz3Ifba9iaKZhMmrrhwONpG3P9pemJzw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>04、申报流程</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OBK0Wz5WVnbVv4EZI75MH0MHrKtLqMt3KuVkUmJvMNnGNBIYUUvtLIEvz3Ifba9iaKZhMmrrhwONpG3P9pemJzw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1、夏令营采用网上报名方式，2025 年 7 月 3 日8：00~7月5日23：59学生登录山东第一医科大学研究生招生信息网“报考系统” https://yz.sdfmu.edu.cn/，选择夏令营项目，首次点击“免费注册”注册账号。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/OBK0Wz5WVnbVv4EZI75MH0MHrKtLqMt3wzYMAjvDbJOzxvADcPo56jcS9Kq3AhJvibiaunkz1tl4EdcOkQKnRwHQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>2、登录后在“填写/修改申请信息”模块中完成报名信息填写、提交。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/OBK0Wz5WVnbVv4EZI75MH0MHrKtLqMt3vARb2TGa30lKsficu05xcNia7BeGZcWqGFWQ7tRrwos8ia8bHwoFtrVUw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>3、选择报考单位，并按照平台要求提交材料：</span></p><p><span>学生证、身份证扫描件；</span></p><p><span>个人电子照片：近期拍摄，正面免冠彩色照片；</span></p><p><span>夏令营申请表，见附件（学生本人签字即可，扫描件上传）；</span></p><p><span>本科成绩单（加盖教务处公章）；</span></p><p><span>英语成绩证明：英语六级成绩单、TOEFL成绩、GRE成绩等证明材料扫描件；</span></p><p><span>科研成果相关证明材料：申请人可提交体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果及获奖证书。无科研成果者可不提交本项材料。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OBK0Wz5WVnbVv4EZI75MH0MHrKtLqMt3nchByqc7wssQicPd4Rn1vnnl8lxTXvq5vaETT9CgmHGiaw4nMQlnGIvg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>扫码查看附件</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OBK0Wz5WVnbVv4EZI75MH0MHrKtLqMt3KuVkUmJvMNnGNBIYUUvtLIEvz3Ifba9iaKZhMmrrhwONpG3P9pemJzw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>05、资格审核</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OBK0Wz5WVnbVv4EZI75MH0MHrKtLqMt3KuVkUmJvMNnGNBIYUUvtLIEvz3Ifba9iaKZhMmrrhwONpG3P9pemJzw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>7月6日14：00前，科创中心对申请人材料进行评估和审核筛选，确定参营名单。7月6日14：00~7月7日11：00学生登录系统查看审核情况，并进行系统确认。入营合格者需要全程参加本次夏令营活动。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OBK0Wz5WVnbVv4EZI75MH0MHrKtLqMt3KuVkUmJvMNnGNBIYUUvtLIEvz3Ifba9iaKZhMmrrhwONpG3P9pemJzw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>06、注意事项</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OBK0Wz5WVnbVv4EZI75MH0MHrKtLqMt3KuVkUmJvMNnGNBIYUUvtLIEvz3Ifba9iaKZhMmrrhwONpG3P9pemJzw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1、本夏令营属于非营利组织，不收取任何费用，主办单位不承担参加者活动期间所产生的任何法律和经济责任。</span></p><p><span>2、夏令营参加者应自觉遵守夏令营期间的各项规定和要求，遵从工作人员的统一安排，不得从事与夏令营无关的任何活动。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OBK0Wz5WVnbVv4EZI75MH0MHrKtLqMt3KuVkUmJvMNnGNBIYUUvtLIEvz3Ifba9iaKZhMmrrhwONpG3P9pemJzw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>07、联系方式</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OBK0Wz5WVnbVv4EZI75MH0MHrKtLqMt3KuVkUmJvMNnGNBIYUUvtLIEvz3Ifba9iaKZhMmrrhwONpG3P9pemJzw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>请有意申报的同学申请入群，入群申请务必备注</span><span><span>“姓名+年级+暑期夏令营”</span></span><span>，未实名备注加群者均不予通过。后续相关通知将在群内公布，不再通过电话方式通知，请大家及时关注。</span></p><p><span>欢迎全国各高校本科优秀毕业生积极报名，更多相关内容请关注山东第一医科大学研究生招生信息网和医学科技创新中心（转化医学研究院）网站相关信息。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/OBK0Wz5WVnbVv4EZI75MH0MHrKtLqMt3ibJTYTdLbvo091x2oDXxIfpoBjQh1tnqtSJNiakrzOYia2NDd3aibfzR1A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>联系人：王老师</span></p><p><span>电话：15063386005</span></p><p><span>QQ群：1009521460</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OBK0Wz5WVnbVv4EZI75MH0MHrKtLqMt3GeGVxlChuPrOxK2kibtnsMa6VTc7XdK8AreysmbJ8iakaPNB5vKoHibNg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OBK0Wz5WVnbVv4EZI75MH0MHrKtLqMt3qapQMjnwMaxHwsKzNr8z958EMrAvxumZFTKQSGxvV8pCUl2QgGNw7g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span> </span><span><span>监制 | 辛   玮</span></span></p><p><span><span> 终审 | 张书平</span></span></p><p><span><span> 撰稿 | 王洋洋</span></span></p><p><span><span> 美编 | 李冬月</span></span></p><p><span><span> 校对 | 蘧雅璇</span></span></p></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"d1faed99bc178c3ec08492efa90a35c71949025dd91e87621d85d3287aebea27","textLength":1495,"sourceSha256":"9d1be93228f56b8b1c172249b860f9cd293b5580e98ca70c43f90502e5068438","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d96d3f44dabf516f0cea","title":"2025年山东第一医科大学医学科技创新中心2025年优秀大学生暑期学术夏令营招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:48.953871+00:00"}
